/Title (3. Countermeasures: Advanced Security Techniques to Strengthen Hidden Communications If the objective shifts from detecting to protecting hidden operational logs, basic LSB replacement is insufficient. To shield sensitive transmissions from detection by forensic analysts, practitioners utilize advanced architectural frameworks that harden the stego-object against extraction and statistical analysis. Technique 1: Implementation of a Double-Layer Hybrid Security Framework \(Pre-Encryption and Compression\): An unencrypted payload injected into an asset leaves a clear forensic trail. If an analyst extracts the payload, the underlying strategy is completely compromised. To prevent this single point of failure, a hybrid mechanism combining cryptography and steganography must be implemented.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
